# topic 约定：home/<site>/stm32/<dev>/...
# site 目前是 dorm（宿舍），设备搬回家后改为 home 或家中实际站点名；
# 控制台用通配符订阅，新增站点无需改 App。

# 设备：只能写自己的状态/遥测，只能读自己的命令
user rong
topic write home/+/stm32/rong/state
topic write home/+/stm32/rong/telemetry
topic write home/+/stm32/rong/status
topic read  home/+/stm32/rong/cmd

# 控制台（Android / PC）：只读设备数据，只能下发命令
user app
topic read  home/+/stm32/+/state
topic read  home/+/stm32/+/telemetry
topic read  home/+/stm32/+/status
topic write home/+/stm32/+/cmd
